  "description": "BOSCH PERFORMANCE LINE SX\n\nCompact. Lightweight. Smart. Weighing only 2 kg, the Bosch motor delivers 60 Nm of torque and up to 400% assistance. It is designed to provide completely natural, smooth, and responsive support, precisely adapting to every terrain and pedaling style.\n\nREAL AUTONOMY FOR LONG RIDES\n\nEquipped with a 400 Wh internal battery discreetly integrated into the down tube, it ensures a range of up to 125 km. The charging port is located on the same tube, protected by a cover for greater durability and safety.\n\nKIOX 400C DISPLAY\n\nDisplays all essential rider data (assistance, navigation, cadence, power, etc.) and is fully customizable. Intuitive and robust, it is designed to withstand the most demanding rides.\n\nREADY TO DEVOUR ROADS\n\nThe iGravelX NX inherits the geometry and design of BH Gravel frames, built to provide balance, agility, and control on any terrain.\n\nINTERNAL CABLE ROUTING\n\nFor a clean frame with no cables visible.\n\nTIRES UP TO 50MM\n\nAllows mounting tires up to 50 mm for extra safety and comfort.*\n\n*Compatible with most brands.\n\nHIDDEN SEATPOST CLAMP\n\nFeaturing a unique and distinctive aesthetic, it is housed inside the seat tube for maximum functionality. Allows a tightening torque of just 5mm for perfect adjustment.",
